      "message": "[warning] Line 257: 🟡 Caching `conversations` in a delegate property can make list membership stale while the picker stays open, because `ContactAdapter.getContactTagConversations()` has no QML-observable dependency to trigger recomputation when contacts/tags change asynchronously. This is a behavioral regression versus computing on click. Add an explicit invalidation dependency (for example, a `ContactAdapter` revision signal/property bumped on contact/tag model updates) and include it in the binding, or recompute in `onClicked` before toggling.",
